  {"id":"techflag/dsh-plugin-ssh","order":304,"name":"dsh-plugin-ssh","owner":"techflag","repo":"techflag/dsh-plugin-ssh","url":"https://github.com/techflag/dsh-plugin-ssh","category":"tools","description":{"zh":"把 SSH 终端、SFTP 文件管理和宿主模型辅助带进 DSH Web；支持多主机会话、指纹校验、可审阅远程命令、原子文件替换与 @服务器 工具调用。","en":"Brings SSH terminals, SFTP file management, and host-model assistance into DSH Web, with multi-host sessions, fingerprint verification, reviewable remote commands, atomic file replacement, and @server tools."},"added":"2026-09-09","curated":false,"topic":true,"stars":1,"forks":0,"openIssues":0,"watchers":0,"pushedAt":"2026-09-09T04:58:18Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T01:26:41Z","createdAt":"2026-09-08T09:18:23Z","license":"MIT","language":"TypeScript","homepage":"https://github.com/techflag/dsh-plugin-ssh#readme","archived":false,"defaultBranch":"main","maintenance":"active","manifest":{"state":"verified","branch":"main","kinds":["bundle","client"],"packageName":"dsh-plugin-ssh","version":"0.1.0","lifecycleScripts":[],"runtimeDependencies":2,"invalidDeclaredPaths":[]},"screenedCommit":"3ae87385bf379d6c2df82fab1856cabe3553e758","installCommand":null,"discovery":{"source":"topic","firstSeenAt":"2026-09-09T05:06:14.333Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-16T12:05:18.904Z"},"screening":{"version":1,"scope":"source","state":"review","risk":"medium","checkedAt":"2026-09-16T12:05:18.904Z","findings":[{"id":"filesystem-write","severity":"medium"}]},"attention":{"level":"review","reasons":["发现本地文件写入能力"]},"passport":{"versionCount":1,"latestCommit":"3ae87385bf379d6c2df82fab1856cabe3553e758","latestCheckedAt":"2026-09-16T12:05:18.904Z","diffSeverity":"baseline","verificationScore":7,"verificationPossible":7},"codexPick":{"repo":"techflag/dsh-plugin-ssh","pickedAt":"2026-09-09T05:06:14.333Z","reviewedCommit":"0342ca8fc8087b007aaa88cb65cc0e49d9bee624","category":"tools","summary":{"zh":"把 SSH 终端、SFTP 文件管理和宿主模型辅助带进 DSH Web；支持多主机会话、指纹校验、可审阅远程命令、原子文件替换与 @服务器 工具调用。","en":"Brings SSH terminals, SFTP file management, and host-model assistance into DSH Web, with multi-host sessions, fingerprint verification, reviewable remote commands, atomic file replacement, and @server tools."},"safety":{"risk":"high","zh":"高风险：插件拥有 SSH/SFTP 权限，可在远程主机执行 Shell、读取、修改和上传文件。可选保存的密码使用本地 AES-256-GCM 文件保护，不具备系统钥匙串的隔离能力。Web 路由限制环回地址与同源写请求，并校验服务器指纹；命令和文件修改接入 DSH 权限确认。建议只接测试主机，使用低权限账号，不保存生产密码，通过 --ignore-scripts 安装，并先在独立 profile 验证。当前最低兼容 DSH 0.1.2-rc.1。","en":"High risk: the plugin has SSH/SFTP authority to execute shell commands and read, modify, or upload files on remote hosts. Optionally saved passwords use local AES-256-GCM files and do not provide system-keychain isolation. Web routes restrict loopback access and same-origin writes, server fingerprints are verified, and command/file mutations use DSH permission confirmation. Use a low-privilege account on a test host, avoid storing production passwords, install with --ignore-scripts, and validate in a separate profile first. Minimum compatibility is DSH 0.1.2-rc.1."}}},
